            "detailed_description": "SAVAGE OFFROAD is a retro-inspired truck racing game set in a post apocalyptic future. It's part racing, part gladiatorial combat and ALL ACTION! Join a tribe of irradiated savages that FIGHT and RACE for the future!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\nSupport for local multiplayer up to 4 players<br />\r\nSingle player mode VS savage AI<br />\r\nRace four trucks or up to 16 for complete brutality<br />\r\nSplit screen or classic top-down view<br />\r\nEliminations - race to win or die trying<br />\r\nUpgrade your truck<br />\r\nCollect turbos and cash on 15 awesome tracks<br />\r\nOriginal Soundtrack",
